<title>USA: America West stake held by FMR group.</title>
<headline>America West stake held by FMR group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp said Thursday it holds a 9.76 percent stake in America West Holdings Corp or 4,446,321 Class B common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said the stake was purchased between January 16 and March 7 at prices ranging from $13.50  to $15.91 per share.</p>
<p>America West airline is based in Phoenix. FMR Corp is the parent to Fidelity Management &amp; Research Co, investment adviser to Fidelity Funds.</p>
</text>
